# Build context for the root Dockerfile (M2-T07). e2e/ stays in: the root `tsc -b` references it.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.claude
spikes
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
.pgdata
.DS_Store
docs
# Local secrets. deploy/gradyserver/env.example has no leading dot, so it stays in.
.env*
# `use-node-version` would make pnpm download its own Node; the base image is already pinned
# to the same version (Dockerfile ARG NODE_VERSION).
.npmrc
